OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds object to batteries on
OL,4,A'Rivals' estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of objections have been lodged
OL,7,Fagainst proposals for a large battery
OL,8,Fstorage facility on a country estate
OL,9,Fused to film hit TV drama Rivals.
OL,11,FRenewable energy company Grenergy wants
OL,12,Fto build a 450MW Battery Energy Storage
OL,13,FSystem (BESS) on land at Neston Park
OL,14,FEstate, near Corsham, Wiltshire, which
OL,15,Fis also home to Peter Gabriel's WOMAD
OL,16,Ffestival.
OL,18,FConcerns from locals over the 216
OL,19,Fbattery containers include fire safety
OL,20,Fand water contamination.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
