OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds object to batteries on
OL,4,A'Rivals' estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrenergy said it takes safety
OL,7,F"extremely seriously" and has a
OL,8,Fstrategy to handle potential fires,
OL,9,Fadding water issues can be safely
OL,10,Fmanaged.
